	"web_text": "This fan's leaf illustrates the fête mobile, or celebrations of the Christian liturgical calendar that occur on movable dates, for 1773. The dates and durations of these holidays are contextualized by the appearance of four standing figures in four quadrants, who personify the seasons, along with names of months, numbers of days, and related zodiac signs listed in small circles throughout.",
